subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Show spending forecast and what-if scenarios

USAGE:
  subtrack forecast <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                           Display this help message
  -v, --version                        Display this version
  --months <months>                    Number of months to forecast (default: 12)
  --cancel <cancel>                    Comma-separated subscription names to exclude
  --addName <addName>                  Hypothetical subscription name to add
  --addPrice <addPrice>                Hypothetical subscription price
  --addCurrency <addCurrency>          Hypothetical subscription currency
  --addCycle <addCycle>                Hypothetical subscription cycle
  -c, --currency <currency>            Convert all prices to target currency
  -j, --json                           Output as JSON

